cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the accompanying data, please cite the paper and this artifact."
title: "Sudoku Fuze-Cell Strategy: Open Reproduction Artifact"
abstract: >-
  Solver sources, benchmark instances, per-instance result files, and analysis scripts
  reproducing every table of the paper "Structure, Irreducibility, and Search Cost in
  Sudoku: Backdoors, Solver-Relative Difficulty, and Adaptive Variable Selection".
  Independently re-tested before release: the two zero-tolerance gate values (29.1144 and
  30.7382 guesses) reproduce to four decimal places under a different compiler and OS
  (MSVC/Windows) than the authoring build (gcc/Linux).
type: software
authors:
